cdc_witness: play {L=0xCD0432B4, R=0x32FBCD4B} and record, 128 frames:
  L = {7'b0, cdc_ones_last[8:0], 7'b0, cdc_ones_max[8:0]}
  R = {0xCD04, cdc_toggles_last[8:0], frame_counter[15:9]}
  cdc_ones/toggles are per 48 kHz frame over 256 TDM8 bit periods;
  the frame counter MUST advance between two knocks or the witness
  is dead and its zeros mean nothing (S81)
