supersedes: dsp4_logic_driveall.c49f4128a083, which stays reachable as
  `./loadlogic.sh driveall-pre85`. The DRIVE_ALL path itself is
  unchanged; the label moved for the same two reasons shipping's did
  (the unconditional witness and CFG_BITS entering the hash).
  CAUTION, and it is S85-7: this build drives i_dspa[5:0] from ONE
  signal, so it cannot tell a correct lane mapping from a permuted one.
  It is a capacity stimulus, not a lane proof. For lane identity use
  LANE_ID=1, where every pin names itself.
